    73	\label{mumford-cor-morphism-translation}
    74	If $A,B$ are abelian varieties and $f:A\to B$ is a morphism, then
    75	$f(x)=h(x)+b$ for a unique $b\in B$ and a homomorphism $h:A\to B$.
